# Keep working copies LF on every platform.
#
# Not cosmetic here: the scripts assert that they contain no raw control bytes,
# and the transcript reader tracks byte offsets into a JSONL file. Letting
# core.autocrlf rewrite line endings on checkout would change byte counts and
# muddy diffs on the one class of bug this codebase is least able to see.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.js    text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
LICENSE text eol=lf
